{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13510","headline":"故太常卿赠礼部尚书李公及夫人挽歌二首 二 · 蒋涣","name":"故太常卿赠礼部尚书李公及夫人挽歌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"封树遵同穴，生平此共归。\n镜埋鸾已去，泉掩凤何飞。\n薤挽疑笳曲，松风思翟衣。\n扬名将宠赠，泉路满光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋涣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}